      en: ["Founded in 1961 to protect local wildlife", "Covers an area of roughly 165,000 hectares", "Key conservation site for African ostriches", "Habitat for over 200 distinct bird species", "Terrain consists of Sahelian savanna and rocks", "Located in the central Guéra region of Chad"],
